[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1387","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1387.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1197","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9124,\"outputTokens\":18,\"totalTokens\":10806}}","description":"SunOS 4.1.1 中的 TIOCCONS 接口未正确校验用户权限，本地用户可通过重定向控制台输入输出实现权限提升。该漏洞影响 SunOS 4.1.1 系统，需本地用户权限即可利用，攻击者可通过恶意重定向控制台输入输出获取提升权限，CVSS 评分 7.2，属于高危本地提权漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1197"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1990-12-20T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:55Z","remediation":"升级到 SunOS 4.1.3 或更高版本（或迁移至 Solaris 2.x 系列），该版本已修复 TIOCCONS 权限检查缺陷。如无法立即升级，可通过停用 /dev/console 重定向功能、限制普通用户对 /dev/console 的访问权限，并将控制台访问限制在受信任的 tty 设备上作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-1990-12.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7140.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/14","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/638563f1ec085a412c2e42f3935801ae34f0dfd9/1999/CVE-1999-1197.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b8f7915616bad1c7280e28216588ab0258074928/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1197.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1197","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ea13d8ca97b52327fe351b64da51866911834231/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1197.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-1197.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/424512debdca84cc53ffa1fb3810a74f7b1905a5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5w36-3rq9-chgj/GHSA-5w36-3rq9-chgj.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154700_154800.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1197.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000009.txt","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1387.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1560","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1560.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1554","title":"SGI IRIX Mail 本地信息泄露漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX 中的 /usr/sbin/Mail 程序在启动时未能正确将组 ID 切换为启动用户的组 ID，导致该程序以错误的组权限运行。本地攻击者可利用此缺陷读取系统中其他用户的邮件内容，造成敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 SGI IRIX 3.3 及 3.3.1 版本，需要本地系统访问权限方可利用，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1554"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1990-10-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:42Z","remediation":"建议升级 SGI IRIX 至 4.0 或更高版本，或安装 SGI 针对该漏洞发布的 Mail 补丁程序。临时缓解措施：以 root 执行 chmod g-s /usr/sbin/Mail 移除 setgid 位，并将邮件目录权限设为 700 以防止其他本地用户越权读取邮件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-1990-08.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/3164.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/13","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1b6397ca00ebc515023ce73df945527011e5cc49/1999/CVE-1999-1554.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e37edb84f090321c2ab4b4aefc57f84a75b1b940/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1554.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1554","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f73aeebc806b7ab5e9488498a056b9fa7bf30dd7/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1554.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-1554.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/26d7afd7aa97d50454756aec5636fa553464ffd2/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-pvqr-8r46-rrwv/GHSA-pvqr-8r46-rrwv.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/13/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154700_154800.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1554.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000008.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1560.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1311","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1311.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1057","title":"VMS ANALYZE/PROCESS_DUMP 命令本地权限提升漏洞","description":"VMS 4.0 至 5.3 版本中的 ANALYZE/PROCESS_DUMP DCL 命令存在权限提升漏洞，本地用户可通过执行该命令获取超出自身权限的系统访问权限。该漏洞源于系统对 DCL 命令的权限检查不充分，导致低权限用户能够利用 ANALYZE/PROCESS_DUMP 功能以更高权限执行操作，进而完全控制受影响的 VMS 系统。攻击者需要拥有本地系统访问权限才能利用此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1057"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1990-10-25T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:36Z","remediation":"升级到 VMS 5.4 或更高版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如无法升级，可通过设置 ANALYZE 命令的 ACL 权限，仅允许授权管理员执行 ANALYZE/PROCESS_DUMP，限制普通用户调用该命令以提升权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/b-04.shtml","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-1990-07.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7137.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/12","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/638563f1ec085a412c2e42f3935801ae34f0dfd9/1999/CVE-1999-1057.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/42b5b7a8a9b34b1b292b9bfd27242e499ccb6cb9/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1057.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1057","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/21d84550d4f5d6b78cac9f7c41b1b20a874c9f15/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1057.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-1057.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d94ad47d0f2016e121b6d251f490e890714f8916/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-q5xx-4g5h-3h6c/GHSA-q5xx-4g5h-3h6c.json","https://github.com/Stallion77RepoOfficial/PoC-Repo/blob/d208666140ed89c18899b79ea93d18444fc164de/1999/1999-1057.py","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154700_154800.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1057.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-1057.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1311.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1492","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1492.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1392","title":"NeXT NeXTstep restore0.9 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"NeXTstep 操作系统中 `/usr/etc/restore0.9` 脚本设置了 SUID 位，导致脚本以 root 权限运行。由于该脚本存在安全缺陷，攻击者可通过注入恶意命令或利用脚本中的逻辑漏洞，在脚本执行过程中以 root 身份执行任意代码，实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响 NeXT 1.0a 及 1.0 版本，本地普通用户无需任何身份认证即可利用，完成提权后完全控制目标系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1392"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1990-10-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:20Z","remediation":"立即移除 `/usr/etc/restore0.9` 脚本的 suid 权限位：`chmod u-s /usr/etc/restore0.9`；如非必要直接删除该脚本：`rm -f /usr/etc/restore0.9`。NeXTstep 1.0/1.0a 已停止维护，建议迁移至现代操作系统，无法升级时严格限制本地用户登录权限并审计 suid 脚本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/b-01.shtml","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-1990-06.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7144.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/9","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1b6397ca00ebc515023ce73df945527011e5cc49/1999/CVE-1999-1392.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/63f7cdb3d3ebf7bfe8ef6a2325af30a024b23325/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1392.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1392","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1392.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-1392.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/491d1a908ffff7b174e17aaac4d0207c13405fa7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mvmr-6989-3jmp/GHSA-mvmr-6989-3jmp.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/9/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1392.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000007.txt","https://github.com/joscanoga/Reto-python-CRM/blob/28c389209e3a121195f01b18344dd568da0600c5/README.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1492.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1492.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1491","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1491.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1391","title":"NeXT NeXTSTEP 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"NeXT 1.0a 及 1.0 系统中存在权限提升漏洞。由于 npd 程序对打印机相关目录的权限设置不当，且目录可被公开访问，本地攻击者可利用 npd 程序结合目录的弱权限配置，通过向打印机目录写入恶意文件或执行特权操作，从而获取系统更高权限。该漏洞影响 NeXT 1.0a 和 1.0 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限方可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1391"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1990-10-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:20Z","remediation":"升级 NeXTSTEP 到 3.0 及以上版本。如无法升级，手动收紧打印机相关目录权限：`chmod 755 /usr/lib/printers && chmod 755 /usr/spool/printers`，并通过 `chmod 700 /usr/etc/npd` 限制 npd 程序仅 root 可执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/b-01.shtml","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-1990-06.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7143.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/10","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1b6397ca00ebc515023ce73df945527011e5cc49/1999/CVE-1999-1391.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/63f7cdb3d3ebf7bfe8ef6a2325af30a024b23325/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1391.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1391","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/376d7933ee02aeea89711d9c7726aad7f10e0a2a/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1391.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-1391.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/491d1a908ffff7b174e17aaac4d0207c13405fa7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jp54-jmhh-2qc4/GHSA-jp54-jmhh-2qc4.json","https://github.com/Stallion77RepoOfficial/PoC-Repo/blob/d208666140ed89c18899b79ea93d18444fc164de/1999/1999-1391.py","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154700_154800.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1391.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--3b6ff907-5a77-47aa-afff-3698f5c975ba.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1491.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0199","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0199.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0084","title":"多款 NFS 服务器权限提升漏洞","description":"某些 NFS 服务器存在权限提升漏洞，由于未对 `mknod` 系统调用进行有效的权限检查，普通用户可通过 `mknod` 创建可写的 `/dev/kmem` 设备文件，并将自身 UID 设置为 0（root），从而获得内核内存的读写访问权限，实现本地权限提升至 root。该漏洞影响多个 NFS 服务实现，攻击者需拥有本地用户账户，CVSS 评分 8.4，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.4,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0084"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1990-05-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:32Z","remediation":"升级至 NFS v4.1.3 或更高版本以修复 mknod 权限提升漏洞。在客户端挂载 NFS 共享时务必使用 `nosuid` 和 `nodev` 选项，禁止设备文件创建和 SUID 可执行；服务端导出目录时启用 `root_squash` 将 root 用户映射为匿名用户，并严格限制 exports 权限为只读（`ro`）而非读写（`rw`），同时移除不必要的 writable kmem 设备访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/78"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0199.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1545","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1545.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1506","title":"Sun SunOS SMI Sendmail 远程访问漏洞","description":"SunOS 系统中 SMI Sendmail 4.0 及更早版本存在安全漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可利用该漏洞访问目标系统上的用户 bin 目录，可能导致敏感信息泄露或进一步权限提升。该漏洞影响 SunOS 4.0.3 及以下版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。建议用户升级至最新版本或应用厂商提供的安全补丁以修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1506"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1990-01-29T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:35Z","remediation":"升级 SunOS 至 4.1 或更高版本（已包含修补后的 Sendmail）；或单独升级 Sendmail 至 5.0 以上版本。如无法升级，安装 Sun 补丁 100078-01/100079-01。临时缓解措施：移除 Sendmail 的 setuid root 权限，将 /usr/lib/sendmail 权限设为 755；或在 inetd.conf 中注释 sendmail 行并重启服务以禁用 SMTP 守护进程。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-90.01.sun.sendmail.vulnerability","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1b6397ca00ebc515023ce73df945527011e5cc49/1999/CVE-1999-1506.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/055024821531fe5a0cbc9011c12b04dd02c9b91a/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1506.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1506","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b486315e56d9788648fd79d97e0d99cfccdee160/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1506.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-1506.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7bd4cbc048c92d100cc76a4a418275826d156a09/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8hgg-xr82-cv8q/GHSA-8hgg-xr82-cv8q.json","https://github.com/Stallion77RepoOfficial/PoC-Repo/blob/d208666140ed89c18899b79ea93d18444fc164de/1999/1999-1506.py","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1506.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--5377fdd7-44ae-4c46-82c3-bc878fe58a94.json","https://github.com/abbushadshaikh/Zentivox-Threat_Intel_Gathering/blob/c8fab3e6b0a1051b7f51731c7c5c936960c6e9bf/zentivox.log"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1545.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1534","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1534.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1467","title":"Sun SunOS rcp 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"SunOS 4.0.x 系统的 rcp（远程拷贝）命令存在认证绕过与任意命令执行漏洞。由于其对 nobody 用户配置不当，来自受信主机的远程攻击者无需有效身份认证即可利用该漏洞以 root 权限执行任意命令，完全控制系统。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重，影响 SunOS 4.0.x 系列版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1467"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1989-10-26T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:30Z","remediation":"立即升级 SunOS 至 4.0.3c 及以上补丁版本，或安装 Sun 官方发布的 rcp 安全补丁。如无法升级，可在 /etc/hosts.equiv 和 .rhosts 中移除不可信主机，并限制 rcp 服务仅对受控网络开放。由于 SunOS 4.0.x 已停止维护，建议迁移至受支持的操作系统（如 Solaris 或 Linux）以彻底消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-1989-07.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3165","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1b6397ca00ebc515023ce73df945527011e5cc49/1999/CVE-1999-1467.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5102a7cca13b4c0a0e55e628783c406707da47e/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1467.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1467","https://github.com/Mishthi27/SentrySense2.0/blob/de64bcf93503f6469484cdfdd5c26732e8f3f623/new_dashboard/predictive_ai/threats/CVE-1999-1467.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e55eacb4f05da66af6c788dc1e36dafe4a12a8f8/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1467.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-1467.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/78550cb05ca9623089e78169330acf979f4b64ca/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-297g-44c7-436q/GHSA-297g-44c7-436q.json","https://github.com/Stallion77RepoOfficial/PoC-Repo/blob/d208666140ed89c18899b79ea93d18444fc164de/1999/1999-1467.py","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154700_154800.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1467.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1534.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1342","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1342.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1122","title":"SunOS restore 命令本地权限提升漏洞","description":"SunOS 4.0.3及更早版本中的restore命令存在本地权限提升漏洞。restore是用于恢复文件系统备份的系统工具，由于在执行文件恢复操作时未正确验证用户权限，导致本地攻击者可通过精心构造的备份文件或利用restore程序在处理文件时的缺陷，在恢复过程中以root权限执行任意操作，从而获得系统最高权限。该漏洞需要攻击者拥有本地系统访问权限，攻击复杂度较低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1122"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1989-07-26T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"SunOS 4.0.3及更早版本已停止支持，官方不再提供安全补丁。建议迁移到受支持的操作系统（如Solaris 11或Linux），并对遗留系统进行网络隔离和严格的本地访问控制，限制非授权用户接触系统控制台和备份恢复工具。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-1989-02.html","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/ciac-08.shtml","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6695"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1342.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1537","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1537.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1471","title":"BSD passwd 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"BSD-based 4.3 及更早版本操作系统的 passwd 工具存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地用户可通过向 shell 或 GECOS 字段提供超长输入触发缓冲区溢出，从而覆盖内存中的关键数据，实现权限提升并获得 root 权限。攻击者需要拥有系统本地访问权限才能利用此漏洞，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1471"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1989-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:30Z","remediation":"升级到 BSD 4.3.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复 passwd 命令中 shell/GECOS 字段的缓冲区溢出问题。如无法升级，可限制本地用户对 passwd 命令的 SUID 执行权限，并审计 /etc/passwd 和 /etc/master.passwd 中异常长度的 GECOS 字段条目。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-1989-01.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7152.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1b6397ca00ebc515023ce73df945527011e5cc49/1999/CVE-1999-1471.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d0edc539747872cdfd58847b81673ec0de903cd8/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1471.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1471","https://github.com/Mishthi27/SentrySense2.0/blob/de64bcf93503f6469484cdfdd5c26732e8f3f623/new_dashboard/predictive_ai/threats/CVE-1999-1471.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e55eacb4f05da66af6c788dc1e36dafe4a12a8f8/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1471.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-1471.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c0ecee517847401d3373d71885a21da53715a840/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3x8m-r3mg-qw2f/GHSA-3x8m-r3mg-qw2f.json","https://github.com/exein-io/kepler/blob/acb566a88795464de78b4a1859800346c6b83f62/domain-db/src/cve_sources/nist/mod.rs","https://github.com/eliasgranderubio/bidDB_downloader/blob/1550b6006d1d21bab726bbe5a10c8c2d7aa94bbc/README.md","https://github.com/Rjkumarkumawat/Al-VulnScan/blob/0de98733f9f4629d2024380affa8e03ba7ceb15c/report.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1537.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0195","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0195.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0082","title":"FTPD CWD ~root 命令权限提升漏洞","description":"FTP 守护进程（ftpd）在处理 CWD（Change Working Directory）命令时存在路径遍历缺陷，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过发送特制的 `CWD ~root` 指令将当前工作目录切换至 root 用户家目录，从而绕过文件访问限制获取超级用户权限，实现对目标服务器的完全控制。该漏洞无需任何认证即可远程触发，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0082"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1988-11-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:32Z","remediation":"升级 ftpd 至厂商最后发布的修复版本（如 wu-ftpd 2.6.2+、ProFTPD 1.2.0rc2+），禁用匿名用户的 CWD 命令或限制 `~root` 路径解析；如无法升级，关闭 FTP 服务并迁移至 SFTP/SCP 替代。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.alw.nih.gov/Security/Docs/admin-guide-to-cracking.101.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0195.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0223","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0223.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0095","title":"Berkeley Sendmail Debug 命令远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Sendmail 5.58 及更早版本中默认启用了调试（debug）命令功能，远程攻击者可通过 SMTP 端口向目标发送特制的 debug 命令，以 root 权限执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响广泛部署的 Berkeley Sendmail 邮件服务器，无需身份认证即可远程利用，危害等级严重。厂商已发布补丁禁用调试功能。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0095"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1988-10-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:34Z","remediation":"立即将 Sendmail 升级至 8.6.x 或更高版本，该系列已默认禁用 debug/wizard 调试命令。如无法升级，在 sendmail.cf 配置文件中添加 Ow 选项（即 O Wizard=no）以关闭 wiz 模式。在网络层面限制对 TCP 端口 25 的访问，仅允许可信来源连接 SMTP 服务作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2019/Jun/16","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2019/06/05/4","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2019/06/06/1","http://www.osvdb.org/195","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19028","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/34851454a7b07498072de47d56f63daa4a4f524d/1999/CVE-1999-0095.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5917e2b15694e167c1fd9ad85775b2bdfc5fe29c/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0095.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0095","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/1999/CVE-1999-0095.rules","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0095.json","https://github.com/Mishthi27/SentrySense2.0/blob/de64bcf93503f6469484cdfdd5c26732e8f3f623/predictive_ai/threats/CVE-1999-0095.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a55bddfc5dd568e972e08b703ab596ed3580b7ba/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0095.json","https://github.com/trailofbits/cb-multios/blob/810d7b24b1f62f56ef49b148fe155b0d0629cad2/challenges/REMATCH_1--Hat_Trick--Morris_Worm/README.md","https://github.com/eldondev/Snort/blob/34bdcf6a7a638b55c7c04f77ef1efa526ad08e33/doc/signatures/663.txt","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0095.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0223.toml"}]